This repo is exempt from its own rules.

Undercoat's decision pages, README and generated AGENTS.md all quote the patterns
they describe — "from-purple-600", "Lorem ipsum", "images.unsplash.com" — so the
rules fire on the documentation about them. That is a false alarm, not a finding.

Note this is NOT why the exemption exists for every hit. The decision pages also
used #6366f1 as their real accent colour, which is a genuine ai-purple-hex catch.
That one is worth fixing rather than exempting.

Delete this file to enforce here.
